        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Merged into a temporary branch to adjust it a bit. I missed that using `|vim.hl.hl_op|` is a bit premature currently, since it only exists for a couple of days. So the vast majority of users would have to use an \"old\" tag although they are on the latest stable release.\r\n\r\nThe solution is probably still use `|vim.hl.on_yank()|` as the \"primary\" tag until Neovim=0.12.x is the latest stable release.\r\n\r\nI plan to merge the temporary branch tomorrow.",
